{"id": "bbad02dc-ba6d-48b1-82dc-669cf9e15780", "slug": "nextgen-robotics-animation", "title": "NextGen Robotics & Animation", "description": "Nextgen Robotics Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"NextGen Robotics & Animation\"\ndescription: \"Nextgen Robotics Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#10B981\"\n  secondary: \"#111111\"\n  accent: \"#10B981\"\n  background: \"#0A0A0A\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# NextGen Robotics & Animation\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Samnang Aing (@samnang). Views: 242; favorites: 5; remixes: 2.\nTags: login, animated, webgl, threejs, input, validation, effect, security.\n## Overview\nNextgen Robotics Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.\n\nAeroMotion Products Technology Documentation Sign in Pre-order Model X-1 Animation Engine Live Fluid dynamics, perfected in real-time. Experience seamless skeletal animation blending. Hover to engage active mode, click…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Fluid dynamics, perfected in real-time.; Animation Mixing; Interactive Blending; Kinetic Camera.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #10B981, secondary #111111, accent #10B981, background #0A0A0A, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>NextGen Robotics & Animation</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Three.js Import Map -->\n    <script type=\"importmap\">\n        {\n            \"imports\": {\n                \"three\": \"https://unpkg.com/three@0.160.0/build/three.module.js\",\n                \"three/addons/\": \"https://unpkg.com/three@0.160.0/examples/jsm/\"\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#0a0a0a] text-zinc-300 font-sans antialiased selection:bg-white/20 selection:text-white\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden;\">\n\n    <!-- Navigation -->\n    <nav class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 border-b border-white/5 backdrop-blur-md bg-[#0a0a0a]/80\" style=\"backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 h-16 flex items-center justify-between\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-white\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:box-linear\" class=\"text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span class=\"font-medium tracking-tight text-sm\">AeroMotion</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-sm font-normal\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Products</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Technology</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Documentation</a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-normal hover:text-white transition-colors hidden sm:block\">Sign in</a>\n                <button class=\"bg-white text-black px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium hover:bg-zinc-200 transition-colors\">\n                    Pre-order\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Main Hero Section -->\n    <main class=\"pt-32 pb-24 px-6 max-w-7xl mx-auto min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-center\">\n        <div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-8 items-center\">\n\n            <!-- Left Text Content -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6 max-w-2xl relative z-10\">\n                <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/5 w-max\">\n                    <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 8px #10b981;\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-normal text-zinc-400\">Model X-1 Animation Engine Live</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <h1 class=\"text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-medium tracking-tight text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-white/50 leading-[1.1]\">\n                    Fluid dynamics,<br>perfected in real-time.\n                </h1>\n\n                <p class=\"text-lg text-zinc-400 font-normal max-w-md leading-relaxed\">\n                    Experience seamless skeletal animation blending. Hover to engage active mode, click to trigger dynamic spatial recalibration.\n                </p>\n\n                <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 mt-4\">\n                    <button class=\"bg-white text-black px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium hover:bg-zinc-200 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        Deploy System\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-base\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 text-white\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:play-circle-linear\" class=\"text-base\"></iconify-icon>\n                        View Demo\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right 3D Canvas -->\n            <div class=\"relative w-full aspect-square md:aspect-video lg:aspect-[4/3] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 bg-[#111] group\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 0 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 20px 40px -20px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\">\n\n                <!-- Overlay Gradients -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-blue-500/10 via-transparent to-purple-500/10 opacity-50 pointer-events-none z-10\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-1/3 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#111] to-transparent pointer-events-none z-10\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Status Indicators -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 z-20 flex gap-2 pointer-events-none\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-black/50 backdrop-blur px-2 py-1 rounded text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500 border border-white/5\">\n                        STATE: <span id=\"ui-state\" class=\"text-white\">IDLE</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Canvas Container -->\n                <div id=\"canvas-container\" class=\"w-full h-full cursor-crosshair\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Features Grid -->\n        <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mt-32 border-t border-white/5 pt-16\">\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\">\n                <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-white/5 border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-white mb-2\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:layers-linear\" class=\"text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                <h3 class=\"text-base font-medium text-white tracking-tight\">Animation Mixing</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-sm font-normal text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed\">\n                    Smooth crossfading between animation clips utilizing optimized keyframe tracks and normalized weight distribution.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\">\n                <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-white/5 border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-white mb-2\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:mouse-linear\" class=\"text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                <h3 class=\"text-base font-medium text-white tracking-tight\">Interactive Blending</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-sm font-normal text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed\">\n                    Trigger additive animations on hover and click events with clamping and precise time scale management.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\">\n                <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-white/5 border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-white mb-2\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:camera-minimalistic-linear\" class=\"text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                <h3 class=\"text-base font-medium text-white tracking-tight\">Kinetic Camera</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-sm font-normal text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed\">\n                    Subtle parallax motion powered by continuous smooth damping algorithms reacting to viewport coordinates.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Three.js Implementation -->\n    <script type=\"module\">\n        import * as THREE from 'three';\n        import { GLTFLoader } from 'three/addons/loaders/GLTFLoader.js';\n\n        // 1. Scene Setup\n        const container = document.getElementById('canvas-container');\n        const uiState = document.getElementById('ui-state');\n\n        const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n        // Match container background, fog for depth\n        scene.background = new THREE.Color('#111111');\n        scene.fog = new THREE.Fog('#111111', 5, 15);\n\n        const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(45, container.clientWidth / container.clientHeight, 0.1, 100);\n        camera.position.set(0, 1.5, 6);\n\n        const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ antialias: true, alpha: true });\n        renderer.setSize(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight);\n        renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n        renderer.toneMapping = THREE.ACESFilmicToneMapping;\n        renderer.toneMappingExposure = 1.2;\n        container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n        // 2. Lighting\n        const ambientLight = new THREE.AmbientLight(0xffffff, 0.5);\n        scene.add(ambientLight);\n\n        const mainLight = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff, 2);\n        mainLight.position.set(5, 10, 7);\n        scene.add(mainLight);\n\n        const fillLight = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0x4f46e5, 1); // Subtle blue fill\n        fillLight.position.set(-5, 0, -5);\n        scene.add(fillLight);\n\n        // Grid helper for grounded feel\n        const grid = new THREE.GridHelper(20, 40, 0xffffff, 0xffffff);\n        grid.material.opacity = 0.05;\n        grid.material.transparent = true;\n        scene.add(grid);\n\n        // 3. Animation Variables\n        const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n        let mixer;\n        let idleAction, hoverAction, clickAction;\n        let currentAction = null;\n        let isHovering = false;\n\n        // Procedural fallback variables\n        let fallbackMesh = null;\n        let targetRotationY = 0;\n        let targetRotationX = 0;\n\n        // 4. Load GLB Model\n        const loader = new GLTFLoader();\n        // Using a reliable public sample model (Fox)\n        const modelUrl = 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KhronosGroup/glTF-Sample-Models/master/2.0/Fox/glTF-Binary/Fox.glb';\n\n        loader.load(\n            modelUrl,\n            (gltf) => {\n                const model = gltf.scene;\n                // Position and scale specific to the Fox model to fit the view\n                model.scale.set(0.025, 0.025, 0.025);\n                model.position.set(0, 0, 0);\n                scene.add(model);\n\n                const clips = gltf.animations;\n                if (clips && clips.length > 0) {\n                    mixer = new THREE.AnimationMixer(model);\n\n                    // Fox GLB typically has: 0: Survey, 1: Walk, 2: Run\n                    idleAction = mixer.clipAction(clips[0]); // Survey (Idle)\n\n                    if (clips.length > 1) hoverAction = mixer.clipAction(clips[1]); // Walk\n                    else hoverAction = idleAction;\n\n                    if (clips.length > 2) clickAction = mixer.clipAction(clips[2]); // Run\n                    else clickAction = hoverAction;\n\n                    // Start Idle\n                    idleAction.play();\n                    currentAction = idleAction;\n                }\n            },\n            undefined,\n            (error) => {\n                console.warn('GLB failed to load. Initializing procedural fallback.', error);\n                initFallback();\n            }\n        );\n\n        function initFallback() {\n            // Create a complex technical looking procedural object\n            const group = new THREE.Group();\n\n            const outerGeo = new THREE.IcosahedronGeometry(1.5, 1);\n            const outerMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\n                color: 0x3b82f6,\n                wireframe: true,\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.3\n            });\n            const outer = new THREE.Mesh(outerGeo, outerMat);\n            group.add(outer);\n\n            const innerGeo = new THREE.IcosahedronGeometry(1.2, 0);\n            const innerMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\n                color: 0x111111,\n                roughness: 0.2,\n                metalness: 0.8\n            });\n            const inner = new THREE.Mesh(innerGeo, innerMat);\n            group.add(inner);\n\n            group.position.y = 1.5;\n            scene.add(group);\n            fallbackMesh = group;\n            uiState.innerText = 'FALLBACK_ACTIVE';\n        }\n\n        // 5. Interaction & Blending Logic\n\n        // Helper to smoothly transition animations\n        function fadeToAction(name, duration) {\n            if (!mixer) return;\n\n            let action;\n            if (name === 'hover') action = hoverAction;\n            else if (name === 'click') action = clickAction;\n            else action = idleAction;\n\n            if (currentAction !== action) {\n                action.reset();\n                action.setEffectiveTimeScale(1);\n                action.setEffectiveWeight(1);\n                action.play();\n\n                currentAction.crossFadeTo(action, duration, true);\n                currentAction = action;\n\n                uiState.innerText = name.toUpperCase();\n            }\n        }\n\n        container.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => {\n            isHovering = true;\n            if (mixer && currentAction !== clickAction) {\n                fadeToAction('hover', 0.5);\n            }\n        });\n\n        container.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {\n            isHovering = false;\n            // Return to center parallax targets\n            targetParallaxX = 0;\n            targetParallaxY = 0;\n\n            if (mixer && currentAction !== clickAction) {\n                fadeToAction('idle', 0.5);\n            }\n        });\n\n        container.addEventListener('click', () => {\n            if (mixer && clickAction) {\n                fadeToAction('click', 0.2);\n\n                // Play click animation (Run) for a short burst, then return\n                mixer.addEventListener('loop', function restoreState(e) {\n                    if (e.action === clickAction) {\n                        mixer.removeEventListener('loop', restoreState);\n                        fadeToAction(isHovering ? 'hover' : 'idle', 0.5);\n                    }\n                });\n            } else if (fallbackMesh) {\n                // Fallback click animation: rapid spin\n                targetRotationY += Math.PI;\n                targetRotationX += Math.PI / 2;\n                uiState.innerText = 'RECALIBRATING';\n                setTimeout(() => { uiState.innerText = 'FALLBACK_ACTIVE'; }, 500);\n            }\n        });\n\n        // 6. Camera Parallax Variables\n        let mouseX = 0;\n        let mouseY = 0;\n        let targetParallaxX = 0;\n        let targetParallaxY = 0;\n\n        container.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n            const rect = container.getBoundingClientRect();\n            // Normalize to -1 to 1\n            mouseX = ((e.clientX - rect.left) / rect.width) * 2 - 1;\n            mouseY = -((e.clientY - rect.top) / rect.height) * 2 + 1;\n\n            targetParallaxX = mouseX * 1.5;\n            targetParallaxY = mouseY * 1.5;\n        });\n\n        // Resize Handler\n        window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n            if(!container) return;\n            const width = container.clientWidth;\n            const height = container.clientHeight;\n            camera.aspect = width / height;\n            camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n            renderer.setSize(width, height);\n        });\n\n        // 7. Animation Loop with Smooth Damping\n        const baseCameraY = 1.5;\n\n        function animate() {\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n            const delta = clock.getDelta();\n\n            // Update GLTF Animation Mixer\n            if (mixer) {\n                mixer.update(delta);\n            }\n\n            // Update Procedural Fallback Animation\n            if (fallbackMesh) {\n                // Continuous slow rotation\n                fallbackMesh.rotation.y += delta * 0.2;\n                fallbackMesh.rotation.x += delta * 0.1;\n\n                // Damped target rotation (triggered on click)\n                fallbackMesh.rotation.y += (targetRotationY - fallbackMesh.rotation.y) * 5 * delta;\n                fallbackMesh.rotation.x += (targetRotationX - fallbackMesh.rotation.x) * 5 * delta;\n\n                // Floating effect\n                fallbackMesh.position.y = 1.5 + Math.sin(clock.getElapsedTime()) * 0.1;\n            }\n\n            // Camera Parallax Damping Formula\n            // current += (target - current) * speed * delta\n            camera.position.x += (targetParallaxX - camera.position.x) * 3 * delta;\n            camera.position.y += ((baseCameraY + targetParallaxY) - camera.position.y) * 3 * delta;\n\n            // Camera always looks at center, creating the 3D parallax feel\n            camera.lookAt(0, 0.5, 0);\n\n            renderer.render(scene, camera);\n        }\n\n        animate();\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "nextgen-robotics-animation.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/nextgen-robotics-animation.jpg", "source_name": "nextgen-robotics-animation-DESIGN.md", "views": 323, "forks": 5, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "66a84ecf-0972-40f3-8a4c-15b11d3aee0a", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T10:15:43.060372+00:00"}